PN,41901
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786882711
OL,3,CRise in number of top A-level grades
OL,5,FThe number of top grades awarded to A-
OL,6,Flevel students in Northern Ireland has
OL,7,Frisen.
OL,9,FMore than 26,000 students received
OL,10,Ftheir A-level, AS-level and BTec
OL,11,Fresults on Thursday.
OL,13,FThe provisional figures show that
OL,14,F30.7% of students received a grade A
OL,15,For above, compared with 30.3% in 2025.
OL,17,FThey also show that 8.8% of entries
OL,18,Fachieved the A* grade, compared with
OL,19,F8.7% last year.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/14
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,420,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786882711
OL,3,CRise in number of top A-level grades
OL,5,FThe total number of A-level entries in
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland was 33,824.
OL,8,FOverall, 98.9% of students in Northern
OL,9,FIreland achieved A* ` E grades,
OL,10,Fcompared with 98.7% in 2025.
OL,12,FMore than one third (38.2%) of A-level
OL,13,Fentries in Northern Ireland continue
OL,14,Fto be in STEM subjects (science,
OL,15,Ftechnology, engineering and
OL,16,Fmathematics).
OL,18,FMathematics remains the most popular A-
OL,19,Flevel subject, accounting for one in
OL,20,F10 entries.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/14
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,420,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786882711
OL,3,CRise in number of top A-level grades
OL,5,FAS-level entries were up from 43,499
OL,6,Fin 2025 to 43,582 this year, an
OL,7,Fincrease of 0.2%.
OL,9,FIn provisional AS outcomes, 27.6% of
OL,10,Fstudents achieved grade A, compared
OL,11,Fwith 27.1% in 2025.
OL,13,FOverall, 96.6% achieved A ` E grades,
OL,14,Fcompared with 96.7% in 2025.
OL,16,FEducation minister Paul Givan visited
OL,17,Fstudents at Friends' School Lisburn
OL,18,Fand said the results were a
OL,19,F"demonstration" of the strength of the
OL,20,Feducation system in Northern Ireland.
OL,26,@{D@AOU{D@OO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/14
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,420,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786882711
OL,3,CRise in number of top A-level grades
OL,5,F"It shows Northern Ireland is still
OL,6,Fperforming very well, and for a lot of
OL,7,Fthese young people today, it's a day
OL,8,Fof celebration," he said,
OL,10,F"They've got the results that they
OL,11,Fwanted, and there's a lot of joy, and
OL,12,Frightly after all of the hard work
OL,13,Fthat they have put in to have got to
OL,14,Fwhere they've got to today, we should
OL,15,Fcelebrate that.
OL,17,F"I know for some young people and
OL,18,Ffamilies, they haven't got the results
OL,19,Fthat they've wanted, and they're
OL,20,Fworking through that process."
OL,26,@mD@AOUpD@PO]rD@AOUyD@AOU|D@^O]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/14
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,420,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786882711
OL,3,CRise in number of top A-level grades
OL,5,FIn March this year, the minister
OL,6,Fannounced his intention to scrap
OL,7,Fstandalone AS levels, to be replaced
OL,8,Fby a new modular A-level with three
OL,9,Funits of assessment taken over two
OL,10,Fyears.
OL,12,FAsked if those changes would continue
OL,13,Fthe trend of rising top grades, Mr
OL,14,FGivan said his reforms will ensure
OL,15,FNorthern Ireland has a "world-class
OL,16,Feducation system".
OL,26,@wD@XOUxD@QO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/14
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,420,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786882711
OL,3,CRise in number of top A-level grades
OL,5,F"Whenever we compare our performance
OL,6,Fin international measurements with
OL,7,Fcountries like Singapore and other
OL,8,Fpowerhouses, we're not performing as
OL,9,Fwell as we can," he said.
OL,11,F"That's why we've embarked upon the
OL,12,FTransformEd reform process with our
OL,13,Fnew curriculum, with a new
OL,14,Fqualifications framework.
OL,16,F"All these young people have sat the
OL,17,Fexams based on the current system,
OL,18,Fwhich is good, but I believe we can be
OL,19,Fbetter. That's why we're embarked upon
OL,20,Fthis transformation.
OL,26,@mD@AOUqD@PO]sD@AOUxD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/14
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,420,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786882711
OL,3,CRise in number of top A-level grades
OL,5,F"And in the years ahead, there'll be a
OL,6,Fdifferent framework for those
OL,7,Fqualifications and that new curriculum
OL,8,Fis out for consultation now, people
OL,9,Fcan have their say on that, but that
OL,10,Fwill allow Northern Ireland to spring
OL,11,Fforward, so that we are competing on
OL,12,Fthat world stage.
OL,26,@mD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G7/14
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,420,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41908
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786882711
OL,3,CRise in number of top A-level grades
OL,5,F"Because often, big companies they're
OL,6,Flooking at how countries perform when
OL,7,Fit comes to their education system,
OL,8,Fthat determines where they will invest
OL,9,Fand we need to be competing at a world
OL,10,Fstage ` not just within a Northern
OL,11,FIreland context or within the United
OL,12,FKingdom ` but we need to be competing
OL,13,Fon the world stage and that's what our
OL,14,Ftransformation process is about."
OL,16,FGerry Campbell, chief executive of
OL,17,FNorthern Ireland's exams board the
OL,18,FCCEA, congratulated all students who
OL,19,Freceived their results.
OL,26,@mD@AOUvD@aO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G8/14
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
