FL,420,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41909
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786882711
OL,3,CRise in number of top A-level grades
OL,5,FHe said: "This moment marks a
OL,6,Fsignificant milestone in your personal
OL,7,Fand educational journey, and everyone
OL,8,Fat CCEA recognises the dedication,
OL,9,Fresilience and hard work that have
OL,10,Fbrought you to this point.
OL,12,F"Your achievements reflect the
OL,13,Fdetermination and growth you have
OL,14,Fshown throughout your studies. You
OL,15,Fshould be incredibly proud of what you
OL,16,Fhave accomplished."
OL,26,@mD@JOUtD@AOUxD@SO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G9/14
