FL,420,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41910
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786882711
OL,3,CRise in number of top A-level grades
OL,5,FHe added: "As you take your next
OL,6,Fsteps, whether into further education,
OL,7,Fhigher education, training, employment
OL,8,For new opportunities, remember that
OL,9,Ftoday's achievements are important
OL,10,Fstepping stones towards your future."
OL,12,FNorthern Ireland Secretary Sir Chris
OL,13,FBryant congratulated students, saying
OL,14,Fthe increase in top A-Level grades
OL,15,Freflected "not just your hard work but
OL,16,Fthat of all the teachers and families
OL,17,Fwho have helped you get there".
OL,26,@mD@KOUrD@eO]wD@KOUyD@^O]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G10/14
