FL,420,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41911
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786882711
OL,3,CRise in number of top A-level grades
OL,5,F"This is an exciting time to build
OL,6,Fyour future in Northern Ireland. There
OL,7,Fisn't just one route ahead. There are
OL,8,Fopportunities in traditional
OL,9,Funiversity degrees, Higher-Level
OL,10,FApprenticeships or stepping directly
OL,11,Finto the workforce," he said.
OL,13,FEconomy Minister Caoimhe Archibald has
OL,14,Fencouraged students to speak to a
OL,15,Fcareers adviser as they consider their
OL,16,Fnext steps.
OL,26,@mD@AOUsD@TO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G11/14
