PN,41912
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786882711
OL,3,CRise in number of top A-level grades
OL,5,FShe said: "I want every young person
OL,6,Fto be able to learn and to thrive.
OL,7,FThere are many options open to you as
OL,8,Fyou begin this exciting new chapter in
OL,9,Fyour lives.
OL,11,F"My department's Careers Service is
OL,12,Fhere to support you with these crucial
OL,13,Fnext steps and help you confidently
OL,14,Ftake the path that is right for you."
OL,26,@mD@KOUsD@AOUvD@eO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G12/14
