CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786882711
OL,3,CRise in number of top A-level grades
OL,5,FHead of the Careers Service, Justin
OL,6,FKerr, said: "The Careers Service can
OL,7,Fhelp explore a range of pathways, with
OL,8,Faccess to up-to-date labour market
OL,9,Finformation on further education,
OL,10,Fhigher education, training and
OL,11,Femployment opportunities.
OL,13,F"There is also a wide range of
OL,14,Finformation online to support those
OL,15,Fconversations and decisions. Students
OL,16,Fand parents/carers can find
OL,17,Finformation on the nidirect careers
OL,18,Fwebsite or speak to the Careers
OL,19,FService by calling 0300 200 7820."
OL,26,@nD@MOUuD@AOU{D@bO]
