OL,3,CRise in number of top A-level grades
OL,5,FPaul Whiteman, general secretary of
OL,6,Fschool leaders' union NAHT,
OL,7,Fcongratulated students receiving
OL,8,Fresults, adding that it is "vital that
OL,9,Fthose coming next have access to a
OL,10,Fpost-16 education system that offers
OL,11,Fgenuine choice and opportunity".
